{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>Before it</b> — twice in the Masorah. The other: כי נכחו יצא in Ezekiel. Just as there, the gate through which he enters he does not exit, as written: 'he shall not return by way of the gate through which he came in, כי נכחו יצא' — so too here, Pharaoh and his army: the way they entered the sea they did not exit through it, but from the other side, as stated in Pesaḥim: just as we ascend from this side, so they ascend from the other side. The Holy One, blessed be He, said to the sea: spit them out on the side through which Israel exited."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:12:46.735184449Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}